  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Ghana - EU Business Forums and Agribusiness Platform events 2024-2026</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The overall objective of the project,&lt;/strong&gt; of which this contract will be a part, is as follows:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;The main objective of this tendering procedure is the improvement of EU-Ghana trade and investment linkages through the organisation of business events and the facilitation of B2B contacts.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Specific objectives:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;The specific objectives are: i) an organisation of two Ghana-EU Business Forums (1&lt;sup&gt;st&lt;/sup&gt; in Q2 2024, 2&lt;sup&gt;nd&lt;/sup&gt; one 2025 or 2026); ii) support to organisation of at least two events of the Agribusiness Platform; iii) graphic design a printing of brochures with EU investment mapping in Ghana iv) support to at least three experts lectures in Accra.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
